{
    "title": "Snow Race 3D: Fun Racing",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0fWould you love to take a snow race? This might be the most fascinating and addicting game you've played!\r\n\r\n\u2744 Do you like making snowballs? Winter is the best time to play. When it snows, you can make snow angels, play snowball fights, and build a giant snowman. \r\nWe are looking for a snowman craftsman. A talented player that can build a snowman fast, race against time and other players.\r\n\r\n\u26c4This race will determine who is the Snow Master! You need to make the snowballs bigger to make way and make the snowballs bigger than other players. Gather the snow around you to make giant snowballs, then make them build ladders and climb up to higher levels. Your opponent will have the same talent, and you will have to race against time and against them.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf67 Get the title of Snowball Master! Join us in this Snow Race 3D game! \ud83d\udca5",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0fWould you love to take a snow race? This might be the most fascinating and addicting game you&#39;ve played!<br><br>\u2744 Do you like making snowballs? Winter is the best time to play. When it snows, you can make snow angels, play snowball fights, and build a giant snowman. <br>We are looking for a snowman craftsman. A talented player that can build a snowman fast, race against time and other players.<br><br>\u26c4This race will determine who is the Snow Master! You need to make the snowballs bigger to make way and make the snowballs bigger than other players. Gather the snow around you to make giant snowballs, then make them build ladders and climb up to higher levels. Your opponent will have the same talent, and you will have to race against time and against them.<br><br>\ud83c\udf67 Get the title of Snowball Master! Join us in this Snow Race 3D game! \ud83d\udca5",
